OL,3,GNEWSAGiant pumpkin grower hopes to beat
OL,4,Aprevious record
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite a dry summer and health issues,
OL,7,Fa world record holding giant vegetable
OL,8,Fgrower believes he is still set to
OL,9,Fbreak his previous record for
OL,10,FStaffordshire's biggest pumpkin.
OL,12,FDerek Hulme, from Stoke-on-Trent, has
OL,13,Fan allotment at Proctors Nursery and
OL,14,Fsaid without their support and access
OL,15,Fto their water supply, he would have
OL,16,Fbeen out of the running this year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
