OL,3,GNEWSAGiant pumpkin grower hopes to beat
OL,4,Aprevious record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 65-year-old is taking his huge
OL,7,Fpumpkin - which he estimates already
OL,8,Fweighs more than 500lb (226kg) - to the
OL,9,FCanna UK National Giant Vegetables
OL,10,FChampionship at the Malvern Autumn Show
OL,11,Flater this month.
OL,13,FHe describes the potential prize winner
OL,14,Fas "the size of a tractor tyre" which
OL,15,Fhe estimates will take five or six
OL,16,Fpeople to move.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
